This plugin is a modified version of the Telegram channel plugin from
https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official (external_plugins/telegram),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes: connects to a self-hosted Office Hub via grammY apiRoot instead of
api.telegram.org; reads OFFICE_HUB_URL / OFFICE_BOT_TOKEN; only runs in sessions
started with OFFICE_SESSION=1; adds thread_id and structured data to inbound
events; restricts permission approval to human approvers; adds status hooks;
removes the Telegram pairing skills.
